body:
Similar to #106122 but for Variant.

The pool is used when creating non-trivial `Variant` ( which rents disposer) and disposing Varaint ( which returns disposer), speeds up Variant creation and Godot methods that return Variant.

Benchmark project: [cs-variant-disposer-pool (1).zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20148527/cs-variant-disposer-pool.1.zip)

<details>
<summary>Benchmark code: </summary>

```cs

using System;
